Usage: delly <command> <arguments>

SV/CNV calling:
    sr           short-read SV discovery
    lr           long-read SV discovery
    asm          assembly-based SV discovery
    cnv          short- or long-read CNV discovery

SV/CNV merging and filtering:
    merge        merge variants
    filter       filter somatic or germline variants

